COMMENT     TPA: Third-Party Annotation derived from ENA metagenome assembly
            ERZ18661299 (contig ERZ18661299.311; BioProject PRJEB47226;
            BioSample SAMEA6872951; raw reads ERR4194644). A 55 bp direct
            terminal repeat (DTR) was trimmed to yield the 34122 bp circularized
            sequence, verified by raw paired-end read mapping (minimap2 -ax sr,
            15.45x mean depth, 100% coverage, 3 reads spanning the entire DTR
            seam).
